---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Affiliate Disclosure | Attirel"
  description="How Attirel earns commissions from retailer links, and why it never affects our sizing advice or fit recommendations."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-article px-5 py-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
      Affiliate Disclosure
    </h1>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/85">
      <p>
        Attirel participates in affiliate marketing programs. When you click a link to a retailer
        from this site or from the Attirel app and make a purchase, we may earn a commission,
        at no additional cost to you.
      </p>
      <p>
        This is how we keep our size guides and the core Attirel experience free. It is also the
        beginning and the end of the arrangement: <strong>retailers do not pay to influence our
        sizing advice, fit assessments, or recommendations</strong>. Our fit guidance is based on
        measurements and each brand's published sizing, never on commission rates.
      </p>
      <p>
        Pages that contain affiliate links carry a disclosure notice near the top. Links that may
        earn a commission are marked with a <code>sponsored</code> attribute in accordance with
        search engine guidelines and FTC disclosure requirements.
      </p>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy? See our
        <a href="/privacy/" class="font-semibold text-plum underline decoration-plum/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-plum">Privacy Policy</a>
        and
        <a href="/terms/" class="font-semibold text-plum underline decoration-plum/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-plum">Terms of Service</a>,
        or reach out via the details on our
        <a href="/about/" class="font-semibold text-plum underline decoration-plum/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-plum">About page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
